	"Description": "Scratch project for the markerless body solve (n09-8), outside the game. Its one module hides the DirectML runtime when run with -LedgerNNECpu, so Epic's body tracker takes its own CPU fallback. Copied to C:/LedgerTools/mocap-solve; source kept in tools/ue/mocap-solve-project.",
